{"version":1,"content":"<p>憑《沒哭聲的抉擇》及《擊情》兩奪金像影后的52歲女星希拉莉絲韻（Hilary Swank），今日透過社交媒體公布再度懷孕喜訊：「很多人問我下一部作品是什麼？</p><p>今年12月將會推出。</p><p>」並附上一條搞笑短片，預告一家四口正期待新生命降臨。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T09:39:48.649268+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T09:17:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T16:17:40.279062+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T09:37:42.028489+00:00","content_hash":"61c4b0d80af45131fce61ebd0443d44d6bc61c52dd4b376e6a2c17b049503c39","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}